From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: the shell's desktop handle has the standard rights (5953)

explorer: the shell's desktop handle has the standard rights

Every program the shell starts (the Run keys, Start, the desktop)
inherits explorer's desktop handle with the same access, and explorer
created its desktop with DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS alone (0x1ff): no
READ_CONTROL, so GetSecurityInfo on the thread's desktop failed with
ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED. Chromium's sandbox reads it to make its alternate
desktop and CHECKs the result: Dropbox 274 (Electron in-process) crashed
at every login, SBOX_ERROR_CANNOT_QUERY_DESKTOP_SECURITY, crash-looping
through its restarter (qa4 Store walk 2026-10-22). A program opening a
desktop by name already got STANDARD_RIGHTS_REQUIRED | DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS
(server connect_process_winstation); the shell's desktop is now created
with the same. The desktop's DACL is unchanged.
Gate: test/deskread-gate.sh (a program explorer /desktop starts: handle
with READ_CONTROL, GetSecurityInfo works); mutant SG_MUTANT_DESKREAD.
---
diff --git a/programs/explorer/desktop.c b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
index 22ba4b0..7a3ea06 100644
--- a/programs/explorer/desktop.c
+++ b/programs/explorer/desktop.c
@@ -44,6 +44,15 @@ WINE_DEFAULT_DEBUG_CHANNEL(explorer);
 
 #define DESKTOP_CLASS_ATOM ((LPCWSTR)MAKEINTATOM(32769))
 #define DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS 0x01ff
+/* the shell's desktop handle, which every program it starts inherits with the same access: with the
+   standard rights, as a desktop opened by name is (the server's connect_process_winstation), so a
+   program can read the desktop's security -- Chromium's sandbox does and CHECKs it (Dropbox 274
+   crashed at every login: SBOX_ERROR_CANNOT_QUERY_DESKTOP_SECURITY, qa4 2026-10-22) */
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_DESKREAD
+#define DESKTOP_SHELL_ACCESS DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS
+#else
+#define DESKTOP_SHELL_ACCESS (STANDARD_RIGHTS_REQUIRED | DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS)
+#endif
 
 static const WCHAR default_driver[] = L"mac,x11,wayland";
 
@@ -3852,8 +3861,8 @@ void manage_desktop( WCHAR *arg )
     {
         DEVMODEW devmode = {.dmPelsWidth = width, .dmPelsHeight = height};
         /* magic: desktop "root" means use the root window */
-        if ((using_root = !wcsicmp( name, L"root" ))) desktop = CreateDesktopW( name, NULL, NULL, DF_WINE_ROOT_DESKTOP, DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS, NULL );
-        else desktop = CreateDesktopW( name, NULL, &devmode, DF_WINE_VIRTUAL_DESKTOP, DESKTOP_ALL_ACCESS, NULL );
+        if ((using_root = !wcsicmp( name, L"root" ))) desktop = CreateDesktopW( name, NULL, NULL, DF_WINE_ROOT_DESKTOP, DESKTOP_SHELL_ACCESS, NULL );
+        else desktop = CreateDesktopW( name, NULL, &devmode, DF_WINE_VIRTUAL_DESKTOP, DESKTOP_SHELL_ACCESS, NULL );
         if (!desktop)
         {
             ERR( "failed to create desktop %s error %ld\n", debugstr_w(name), GetLastError() );
